---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { SOCIAL } from '../../config/site';
import '../../styles/donate.css';
---
<Base title="Donate · Team StormBreaker" description="Support Team StormBreaker — help cover servers, CI and test devices.">
  <main>
    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="donate">
          <svg class="heart" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-6.7-4.35-9.33-8.02C.9 10.3 1.4 6.9 3.9 5.35a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 6.1.9L12 8.3l2-2.05a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 6.1-.9c2.5 1.55 3 4.95 1.23 7.63C18.7 16.65 12 21 12 21z"/></svg>

          <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:26px">
            <span class="kicker">Support us</span>
            <h2>Donate</h2>
          </div>

          <p>
            StormBreaker is <strong>free and always will be</strong>. Every kernel, build and late-night
            bugfix is volunteer time from people who just love making Android devices better.
          </p>
          <p>
            If our work has helped your phone run faster, cooler or longer — and you’d like to say
            thanks — a small tip genuinely means a lot. It helps cover <strong>servers, CI and test
            devices</strong>, and honestly, it just makes our day. 💜
          </p>
          <p>There’s zero pressure, and no feature is ever paywalled. Thank you for being here.</p>

          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href={SOCIAL.paypal} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <Icon name="paypal" /> Donate via PayPal
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="small">Securely handled by PayPal · paypal.me/saalimquadri</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
